Design a 4-bit adder that increments a 4-bit input A by 5. The output Y will be the 4-bit result of A + 5. If the result of A + 4 exceeds 3, Y will simply be the lower 3 bits of that result; otherwise, it will add 1 to those bits, ensuring the correct 4-bit representation of the addition.
module top_module(
    input [3:0] A,
    output [3:0] Y
);

